<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 70.7796 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 70.7796 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 70.7796 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday from 70.5315 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 14		  Nov 13</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  70.7796		 70.5315</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	 1.850		   4.595</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
